--- text
Your order is cancelled

Order [ORDER_NUMBER] is cancelled. The reason on record is
[CANCEL_REASON]. Nothing from this order will be sent, and your
payment method will not be charged for it.

Details of the cancellation

Order number: [ORDER_NUMBER]
Cancelled on: [EVENT_TIME]
Reason: [CANCEL_REASON]

If you were charged for this order, [CURRENCY] [REFUND_AMOUNT]
goes back to you by [REFUND_METHOD]. Allow [REFUND_DAYS] for it to
appear, because your bank sets the timing once we send the money.

If the payment was only held and never taken, no money left your
account and there is nothing to refund. The hold is released and
drops off your statement within [REFUND_DAYS].

Items cancelled from order [ORDER_NUMBER]

Item: [ITEM_1_NAME]
[ITEM_1_VARIANT]
Qty: [ITEM_1_QTY]
Amount: [CURRENCY] [ITEM_1_AMOUNT]

Nothing needs to be returned. To buy these items again, place a new
order at the price in effect at that time.

View this order:

[CTA_URL]

If you did not ask for this cancellation, or the refund has not
arrived after [REFUND_DAYS], reply to this email, or write to
[SUPPORT_EMAIL]. A real person reads every message.

[SIGNOFF_NAME], [COMPANY_NAME]
